        <reimplements refid="classllvm_1_1raw__ostream_1ad65ed6b6a8c96b6c1dc98ba50bc1547a">reserveExtraSpace</reimplements>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="classuint64__t" kindref="compound">uint64_t</ref></type>
          <declname>ExtraSize</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If possible, pre-allocate <computeroutput>ExtraSize</computeroutput> bytes for stream data. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>i.e. it extends internal buffers to keep additional ExtraSize bytes. So that the stream could keep at least <ref refid="classllvm_1_1raw__ostream_1a0f90ad570f71349466844ee9f2d06cd1" kindref="member">tell()</ref> + ExtraSize bytes without re-allocations. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1raw__string__ostream_1ab6404e90b84bda345a98539075706232" kindref="member">reserveExtraSpace()</ref> does not change the size/data of the stream. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
